; Compact Thermal Glass: reduced padding; physical readings use two decimals.
; Source-based frametime uses MSI Afterburner for configurable decimal formatting.
; Native RTSS per-application FPS/API/history graphs remain in use.
; Glass tint 15%; no images, blur shader, hardware access or application settings changes.
